    "type": "game",
    "name": "Blueberry Tales",
    "steam_appid": 3328770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328770/extras/62be0251ba380ae99553a00e6226c885.webp?t=1732859828\" width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the captivating adventure of <i>Blueberry Tales</i>, a narrative game combining exploration and legendary mysteries! You play as <strong>Charly</strong>, an intrepid young hero who embarks on an extraordinary quest through the varied landscapes of France and Switzerland. Guided by the rumor of the great mage G Milgram and his famous <strong>14 quantum creams</strong> with prodigious powers, <strong>Charly</strong> will have to uncover the secrets of a priceless treasure hidden for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, Charly will meet colorful characters, each with their own crazy theories and unique personality. But that's not all: he will learn essential techniques that will help him overcome unexpected challenges and reveal the truth behind the mysterious <strong>Discord group</strong>, which seems to know much more than it lets on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to solve the puzzles, discover the legendary creams, and open the chest of a thousand riches? Charly's destiny is in your hands in <i>Blueberry Tales</i>, an adventure full of secrets, humor and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore, solve and triumph. The story begins here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328770/extras/e3b8ab5d0620bdf8395ebabe053d0d5e.webp?t=1732859828\" width=800 height=51 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free* <strong>Soundtrack</strong> Included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game <strong>Speedrun</strong> Option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated <strong>Discord RPC</strong> and <strong>Steam RPC</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Soundtrack is licensed under CC BY-NC-ND</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328770/extras/d94b50df5d15460356772573d9dc9f60.webp?t=1732859828\" width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created following G Milgram's treasure hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO NOT TAKE THIS GAME SERIOUSLY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the themes discussed, as well as some elements of the lore, may offend some sensibilities. Indeed, the game refers to esoteric concepts and/or pseudo-sciences such as the quantification of objects, geobiology, etc., which can be interpreted in a very personal way. If you are sensitive to these subjects, we invite you to find out more before embarking on the adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328770/extras/62be0251ba380ae99553a00e6226c885.webp?t=1732859828\" width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the captivating adventure of <i>Blueberry Tales</i>, a narrative game combining exploration and legendary mysteries! You play as <strong>Charly</strong>, an intrepid young hero who embarks on an extraordinary quest through the varied landscapes of France and Switzerland. Guided by the rumor of the great mage G Milgram and his famous <strong>14 quantum creams</strong> with prodigious powers, <strong>Charly</strong> will have to uncover the secrets of a priceless treasure hidden for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, Charly will meet colorful characters, each with their own crazy theories and unique personality. But that's not all: he will learn essential techniques that will help him overcome unexpected challenges and reveal the truth behind the mysterious <strong>Discord group</strong>, which seems to know much more than it lets on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to solve the puzzles, discover the legendary creams, and open the chest of a thousand riches? Charly's destiny is in your hands in <i>Blueberry Tales</i>, an adventure full of secrets, humor and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore, solve and triumph. The story begins here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328770/extras/e3b8ab5d0620bdf8395ebabe053d0d5e.webp?t=1732859828\" width=800 height=51 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free* <strong>Soundtrack</strong> Included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game <strong>Speedrun</strong> Option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated <strong>Discord RPC</strong> and <strong>Steam RPC</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Soundtrack is licensed under CC BY-NC-ND</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328770/extras/d94b50df5d15460356772573d9dc9f60.webp?t=1732859828\" width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created following G Milgram's treasure hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO NOT TAKE THIS GAME SERIOUSLY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the themes discussed, as well as some elements of the lore, may offend some sensibilities. Indeed, the game refers to esoteric concepts and/or pseudo-sciences such as the quantification of objects, geobiology, etc., which can be interpreted in a very personal way. If you are sensitive to these subjects, we invite you to find out more before embarking on the adventure.</p>",
